#created by Duel Circuit - Orvel's House (Power Patron, 2026, with The Black Market's contraband)
#era 2026
#tier Alley authored deck: Orvel's Table, the House (docs/dev/ALLEY-SPEC-2026-11-01.md section 6, decision O1)
#about Patron Orvel's own Power Patron Pendulums (decks/history/power-patron.ydk) with the House's habits: no hand traps or board breakers (he doesn't interrupt; he underwrites), a leaner engine, and one copy each of sixteen of The Black Market's contraband cards in their place.
#why Out: 3 Mulcharmy Fuwalos, 3 Infinite Impermanence, 3 Pot of Sloth, 2 Lightning Storm, 2 Book of Eclipse, 2 Medius the Pure, 1 Pendulum Treasure. In: Pot of Greed, Graceful Charity, Monster Reborn, Change of Heart, Harpie's Feather Duster, Heavy Storm, Snatch Steal, Brain Control, Premature Burial, Solemn Judgment, Morphing Jar, Return from the Different Dimension, Mirage of Nightmare, Crush Card Virus, That Grass Looks Greener, Chaos Sorcerer. Measured 2026-11-02 (the alley study's duel: the QA stand-in planning with its best deck, Fire King Snake-Eye, against Orvel planning at skill 1.0, the turn cap): the player won 52.9% of 240 (target 55-60%). The list as built: 51% of 100; only the hand traps swapped: 48% of 560.
